title: fight3
---
The Player appears! <<once if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Dr. iur. Acula">>
The Player appears! <<once if $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
The Player appears! <<once if $charname == "Mothperson">>
The Player appears! <<once if $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
The Player appears! <<once if $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
<<if $leave == false and $date != 100>>
The player is confused! <<if $conf == true>>
The player is ... horny? <<if $horny == true>>
What will {$charname} do? (Player attraction {$date}/100)
-> Special Moves
<<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Dr. iur. Acula">>
        -> Step on Player.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                The Player evades the shoe!
                <<set $conf to false>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                That's very effective!
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $horny to false>>
                The Player has somehow stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player seems to like that?
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $horny to true>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Akademische Grade.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                Somehow the Player seems to understand perfectly.
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $conf to false>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                The Player doesn't get it but they enjoy listening!
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $horny to false>>
                <<set $conf to true>>
                The Player has stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player doesn't seem to get it.
                <<set $conf to true>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Chomp.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                That's very effective!
                <<set $conf to false>>
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $horny to true>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                That's very effective!
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $horny to false>>
                The Player has somehow stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player does not want to be eaten.
                <<set $date to $date - 10>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        -> Bewitch the Player.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                The Player is charmed.
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $conf to false>>
                <<set $horny to true>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                The Player does not seem to want that.
                <<set $horny to false>>
                The Player has stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                That may have been the wrong spell but it's working.
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $conf to true>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Sexy broom dance.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                The Player is vibing.
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $conf to false>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                The Player is really enjoying the show.
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $horny to false>>
                The Player has somehow stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player is interested.
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $horny to true>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Cackle.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                That's very effective! But not in a good way.
                <<set $conf to false>>
                <<set $date to $date - 10>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                The Player seems into it?
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $horny to false>>
                The Player has stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player laughs along.
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $conf to true>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        -> Lämp. <<if $lamp == 0>>
            More Lämp?
            <<set $date to $date + 10>> 
            <<set $lamp to 1>>      
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Big Lämp. <<if $lamp == 1>>
            Even more lämp?
            <<set $date to $date + 20>> 
            <<set $lamp to 2>>  
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Great Lämp. <<if $lamp == 2>>
            LÄMP.
            <<set $date to $date + 30>> 
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        -> Smirk.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                The Player is even more confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                That's very effective!
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $horny to false>>
                The Player has somehow stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player blushes.
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $horny to true>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Use tentacles *wink*
            <<if $conf == true>>
                At least someone is enjoying themselves.
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $conf to false>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                The Player is overwhelmed
                <<set $horny to false>>
                <<set $conf to true>>
                The Player has stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player seems very enthusiastic.
                <<set $horny to true>>
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Splash.
            Nothing happens.         
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        -> Crush Player.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                The Player loves to be squeezed!
                <<set $conf to false>>
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $horny to true>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                *crack* The Player may have broken a bone.
                <<set $date to $date - 10>>
                <<set $horny to false>>
                The Player has stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player seems very relaxed.
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> 1000 Pushups.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                The Player cheers you on.
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $conf to false>>
                <<set $horny to true>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                The Player is really into it but doesn't understand why.
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $horny to false>>
                <<set $conf to true>>
                The Player has somehow stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player tries to count the pushups but accidentally falls asleep.
                <<set $conf to true>>
                The Player wakes up again.
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Flex.
            <<if $conf == true>>
                That's very effective!
                <<set $conf to false>>
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $horny to true>>
                The Player is no longer confused!
            <<elseif $horny == true>>
                That's very effective!
                <<set $date to $date + 20>>
                <<set $horny to false>>
                The Player has somehow stopped being horny.
            <<else>>
                The Player starts drooling.
                <<set $date to $date + 10>>
                <<set $horny to true>>
            <<endif>>         
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<endif>>
-> Inventory
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Dr. iur. Acula">>
        -> Stethoscope. <<once>>
            The Player is unsure what is happening.
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Wig. <<once>>
            Snatched!
            <<set $conf to false>>
            <<set $horny to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Letter from the President. <<once>>
            Impressive, yet ain't nobody got time to read all that.
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to false>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        -> Wand. <<once>>
            It's old and doesn't work anymore.
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to false>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Horny potion. <<once>>
            Uh oh, seems like someone switched the potion labels.
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Confusion potion <<once>>
            Uh oh, seems like someone switched the potion labels.
            <<set $conf to false>>
            <<set $horny to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        -> Sunglasses. <<once>>
            What are they doing in this inventory?
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Lighter. <<once>>
            High risk, high reward. Use with caution.
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to false>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Ring light. <<once>>
            The Player appreciates the impeccable lighting.
            <<set $conf to false>>
            <<set $horny to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        -> Abs. <<once>>
            Yes, it doesn't make sense for these to be in an inventory. No, I don't care. Sue me.
            <<set $conf to false>>
            <<set $horny to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Eels. <<once>>
            Ah. Very dangerous.
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to false>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Poseidon's Trident. <<once>>
            Is that the real one?
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        -> A pack of cigarettes. <<once>>
            Isn't that like really unhealthy?
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Kettlebell. <<once>>
            Too heavy for the Player.
            <<set $horny to false>>
            <<set $conf to false>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
        -> Bandages. <<once>>
            The Player is obviously having some... interesing thoughts.
            <<set $conf to false>>
            <<set $horny to true>>        
            <<jump fight3>>
    <<endif>>
-> Random
    => A toad appears.
        <<set $horny to false>>
        <<set $conf to true>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => A Lavoodoo appears.
        <<set $horny to false>>
        <<set $conf to true>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => A cat runs in an scratches the Player.
        <<set $date = $date - 10>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => The Player gets struck by lightning.
        They survive this.
        <<set $date to 0>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => An angelic choir starts singing.
        <<set $date to $date + 10>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => Amor's arrow missed the Player by half an inch.
        Noone notices.
        <<set $horny to false>>
        <<set $conf to false>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => Rose petals start falling from the ceiling.
        <<set $date to $date + 10>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => Hideo Kojima appears and congratulates Love and Lizards Studio on their game.
        <<set $date to $date + 50>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => The Player gets stung by a bee.
        Ouch.
        <<set $date to $date - 20>>
        <<set $horny to false>>
        <<set $conf to false>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => The Player finds 15 Euro.
        Now they can buy Currywurst.
        <<set $horny to false>>
        <<set $conf to true>>
        <<set $date to $date + 10>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => The Player accidentally sees an ankle.
        <<set $conf to false>>
        <<set $horny to true>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => The ancient deity on whose just as ancient temple grounds the Villa was built curses the Player.
        Luckily it is only a very minor ancient deity.
        <<set $conf to false>>
        <<set $horny to true>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    => The moon/The Great Lämp is full tonight.
        <<set $conf to false>>
        <<set $horny to true>>
        <<set $date to $date + 10>>
        <<jump fight3>>
-> Leave
    Are you sure?
    -> Yes.
        <<set $leave to true>>
        <<jump fight3>>
    -> No.
        <<jump fight3>>
<<elseif $leave == true>>
    Really?
<<elseif $date >= 100>>
    That was fun!
<<endif>>
===